Subject: [PATCH] docs: align governance, roadmap, and state with repository
 reality

Record the owner-approved PatchForge-first execution order in ADR 0010
without renumbering phases, and add explicit precedence notes to the master
prompt and project instructions so stale sequencing cannot override the
roadmap, ADRs, or PROJECT_STATE.

Rewrite the README for first-time readers, condense PROJECT_STATE for
session recovery (removing a machine-specific worktree path), move Phase 7
history to docs/milestones, add a Brain v1 implementation status to
BRAIN.md, regroup CHANGELOG by package version, fix runbook drift (model
required by preflight, run file names, lock schema 2), make the Makefile
portable, and append a labeled independent-review addendum to the Brain v1
calibration report. No source behavior, frozen artifact, or hash changes.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
